• Author Lambda@Edge viewer-request token validator for /protected/* path and wire its ARN into CloudFront cache behavior (replace placeholder in cf-config.json).\\\\n\\\\nFrontend Director\\\\n• Use Amplify Studio Content Manager + DataStore; configure with SSM-fetched AppSync API ID and REGION.\\\\n• No changes needed to hosting, auth, or CI/CD portions.\\\\n\\\\n--- End of Addendum ---\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderSequenceID\\\": \\\"arch_rev_1\\\"\\n}\\n###arch_rev_1###\"}]},\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":7554,\"outputTokens\":1369,\"totalTokens\":8923},\"custom\":{\"id\":\"chatcmpl-BwD3esC7olrergNeo9gaht1Ugo4il\",\"object\":\"chat.completion\",\"created\":1753212918,\"model\":\"o3-2025-04-16\",\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"###arch_rev_1###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: REPORT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reportString\\\": \\\"**ADDENDUM — DEP Delta Updates (AppSync & Delegations)**\\\\n(Only changes; everything not mentioned remains as in original DEP.)\\\\n\\\\n========================================================\\\\n1. API LAYER – Replace API Gateway + Lambda with AWS AppSync GraphQL\\\\n========================================================\\\\nREMOVE: Step 6 that created API Gateway & authorizer.\\\\nADD NEW STEP 6 (fully deterministic CLI):\\\\n```bash\\\\n# ---------- Step 6 – AppSync GraphQL API backed by DynamoDB ----------\\\\nAPPSYNC_API_NAME=\\\\\\\"${PROJECT}-graphql-api\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n# 6a. Create GraphQL API secured by Cognito\\\\nAPPSYNC_API_ID=$(aws appsync create-graphql-api \\\\\\\\ \\\\n    --name $APPSYNC_API_NAME \\\\\\\\\\\\n    --authentication-type AMAZON_COGNITO_USER_POOLS \\\\\\\\\\\\n    --user-pool-config userPoolId=$(aws ssm get-parameter --name \\\\\\\"$PARAM_PREFIX/user-pool-id\\\\\\\" --query 'Parameter.Value' --output text),awsRegion=$REGION,defaultAction=ALLOW \\\\\\\\\\\\n    --query 'graphqlApi.apiId' --output text)\\\\naws ssm put-parameter --name \\\\\\\"$PARAM_PREFIX/appsy